# WebOnOne v2 project

Agent skill: [.cursor/skills/webonone-agent/SKILL.md](../skills/webonone-agent/SKILL.md)

## Scope

`webonone-v2/frontend`, `webonone-v2/backend`, `webonone-v2/backend/migrations`.

Specs: [04-webonone-v2-project.md](../../spec/1.0.0/04-webonone-v2-project.md), [07-identity-webonone-integration.md](../../spec/1.0.0/07-identity-webonone-integration.md)

## Ports and env

| Layer | Port | Env file |
|-------|------|----------|
| Frontend | 3000 | `webonone-v2/frontend/.env` |
| Backend | 4000 | `webonone-v2/backend/.env` |

`JWT_SECRET` must match Identity backend.

## 1.0.0 status

Product shell only: health API, JWT middleware, redirect login to Identity, placeholder home. No domain tables yet.

## Ownership

- `/login` redirects to Identity — **no local login forms**.
- `/callback` exchanges auth code for JWT via Identity API.
- JWT **verification** locally; no per-request Identity HTTP on hot paths.
- Database: `webonon_v2`.

Key paths: `features/auth/pages/AuthCallbackPage.tsx`, `features/auth/utils/buildIdentityLoginUrl.ts`, `backend/src/middleware/auth.ts`.

## Verification

```bash
npm run type-check -w webonone-v2-root
```

Login flow requires Identity running (`npm run dev:identity`).
